Subject: [PATCH 2/2] ARM: i.MX8MP: Add DEBIX SOM A and SOM A I/O Board support
X-SA-Exim-Version: 4.2.1 (built Wed, 08 May 2019 21:11:16 +0000)
X-SA-Exim-Scanned: Yes (on metis.ext.pengutronix.de)

By this commit the 8G variant of the Polyhex Debix SoM A [1] and the SOM
A I/O board [2] is added.

Detecting the ram configuration during runtime would be great but at the
moment this is not supported. The 8G RAM configuration comes from the
downstream vendor u-boot.

[1] https://debix.io/hardware/debix-som-a.html
[2] https://debix.io/hardware/debix-som-a-io-board.html

Signed-off-by: Marco Felsch <m.felsch@pengutronix.de>
